flowchart TD
    Request[Incoming request] --> Transport{HTTPS and trusted proxy?}
    Transport -- no --> Reject[Reject or redirect safely]
    Transport -- yes --> Host{Host is verified and active?}
    Host -- no --> FailClosed[Fail closed without tenant lookup]
    Host -- yes --> Session{Session valid for tenant?}
    Session -- no --> PublicOr401[Public route or 401]
    Session -- yes --> Permission{Role, permission, ownership?}
    Permission -- no --> Forbidden[403 or safe not-found]
    Permission -- yes --> Execute[Execute tenant-scoped operation]
    Execute --> Log[Sanitized audit and correlation metadata]
    Log --> Response[Response with safe error shape]
    Reject --> Log
    FailClosed --> Log
    PublicOr401 --> Log
    Forbidden --> Log

    Note1[Do not log tokens, secrets, raw credentials, or sensitive payloads.] -.-> Log
    Note2[Client-selected organization or database ids are never authority.] -.-> Host